# SfxLab family v2: layer id name type dur seed key=value... (dur 0 = endless) · range id param lo hi [note] · bind signal id|* param [lo hi] [rel] [steps=N | scale=<chord>] · note text · then `spell <id>` sections: name, recipe, the spell's layers at their lock values, its binds and notes
bench 1
root 65.4064
# gravitic: the notes are made by oscillators. Four dark voices whose pitch swings slowly, like something in a loose orbit, and settles as the
# ratios lock; a pure C1 sub that grows with the machine. The bed recording stays, retuned a semitone up onto C (it sat on B).
