range bed level 0.15 0.35 rests at 0.35, back to 0.22 with stir, and lower still as the machine fills (stack)
range bed lfo>cut 0 0.6 the slow filter wobble (0.35 Hz), deeper with the orb's speed
range halo level 0 0.14 the bed's own partials an octave up: the mids that let the family carry on small speakers, in with stir
range sub level 0 0.09 mass: a pure sine at C1 that grows with the machine
range root level 0 0.05 C3: a dark, mostly-sine tone
range root lfo_rate 0.5 3 how fast it swings: the pen's speed
range root lfo>pitch 0 0.5 the swing: half a semitone either way at coherence 0 (a loose orbit), none at 1 (captured)
range third level 0 0.044 E3
range fifth level 0 0.044 G3
range seventh level 0 0.035 Bb3
range cloud level 0 0.3 the chord, growing with the number of motions; spells raise it and pick the chord
range cloud gather 0.5 1 a soft cluster while searching, the chord once every ratio is an integer
range cloud phaser 0 1
range tide level 0 0.35 the near-miss flicker: the slow rising-falling loop, low-passed
bind stir bed level 0.35 0.22
bind stir halo level 0 0.14
bind stack bed level 0 -0.08 rel
bind stack sub level 0 0.09
bind orb.speed bed lfo>cut 0 0.6
bind stack cloud level 0 0.3
bind coherence cloud gather 0.5 1
bind radiance cloud reverb 0.5 0.9
bind orb.radius halo cutoff 0.3 0.9
bind orb.curl cloud drift 0.1 0.45
bind score tide level 0 0.35
bind tone.root root level 0 0.05
bind coherence root lfo>pitch 0.5 0
bind orb.speed root lfo_rate 0.5 3
bind fit root shimmer 0.3 0
bind orb.radius root cutoff 0.4 0.75
bind tone.third third level 0 0.044
bind coherence third lfo>pitch 0.5 0
bind orb.speed third lfo_rate 0.5 3
bind fit third shimmer 0.3 0
bind orb.radius third cutoff 0.4 0.75
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.044
bind coherence fifth lfo>pitch 0.5 0
bind orb.speed fifth lfo_rate 0.5 3
bind fit fifth shimmer 0.3 0
bind orb.radius fifth cutoff 0.4 0.75
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.035
bind coherence seventh lfo>pitch 0.5 0
bind orb.speed seventh lfo_rate 0.5 3
bind fit seventh shimmer 0.3 0
bind orb.radius seventh cutoff 0.4 0.75
bind orb.accel root drive 0 0.25
bind hand.fit halo level 0 0.12 rel
bind hand.fit cloud phaser
note gravitic v2 (2026-10-03). Why: measured, v1's recordings were off their notes. The bed and halo sat on B (not C), the sub on a G#/B cluster,
note the 'third' on F# (not E), the 'fifth' on F# +40c (not G), the root wub 39 cents flat with an F# in it. Against a cloud and a seventh on C that is a constant rub.
note Here: the bed and halo are retuned +0.97 st onto C; the sub is a pure sine at C1 (stack); the four voices are oscillators at C3 E3 G3 Bb3 (tone.*).
note in tune = capture: each voice's pitch swings slowly (lfo>pitch 0.5 -> 0 with coherence) and comes to rest; the pen's speed sets how fast it swings.
note cloud, tide, one-shots and spells are v1's (their bed lines are retuned and their sub is the sine).
note Reach hint: hand.fit (the reach of the component in hand against the recipe the stations point to) adds a little to one layer when it is right, and nothing otherwise; fit steadies the voices.
note Recipes are the sigil generator's (seed 1, 2026-10-03). Spell notes that name ratios or chord tones describe the earlier, hand-made recipes.

